msgstr "小区锁定已保存。请重新连接接口以生效。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wwand/status.js:879
msgid ""
"Cell/frequency locks the modem currently has armed — the read-back of the "
"cell-lock editor, showing what the modem ACTUALLY locked"
msgstr "调制解调器当前已启用的小区/频点锁定 — 小区锁定编辑器的回读值，显示调制解调器实际锁定的目标"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/statistics/rrdtool/definitions/wwand.js:32
msgid "Cellular modem"
msgstr "蜂窝调制解调器"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wwand/modems.js:120
msgid ""
"Cellular modems managed by wwand. Each modem is referenced from an interface "
"(Network → Interfaces, protocol \"Cellular / 5G\") by its name; several "
"interfaces can share one modem through different mux channels. \"Config\" "
"edits the modem, \"Tools\" opens band/operator/SIM/eSIM/SMS tools for it."
msgstr "由 wwand 管理的蜂窝调制解调器。每个调制解调器通过名称被接口（“网络 → 接口”，协议“Cellular / 5G”）引用；多个接口可通过不同的多路复用通道共享同一个调制解调器。“配置”用于编辑调制解调器参数，“工具”用于打开频段、运营商、SIM、eSIM 和短信工具。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wwand/status.js:50
msgid "Channel bandwidth of the carrier"
msgstr "载波的信道带宽"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wwand/settings.js:897
msgid "Choose a storage and click Load."
msgstr "选择存储位置并点击“加载”。"

