#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/wwand/modemopts.js:257
msgid ""
"How SIM Application Toolkit is routed. A router has no screen to display "
"operator menus or texts on, so a modem advertising a phone-like profile can "
"leave the card waiting for a response nothing here will send. \"disabled\" "
"stops routing toolkit to a control point. Unset leaves the modem exactly as "
"the vendor configured it."
msgstr "SIM 卡应用工具包 (STK) 的路由方式。路由器没有屏幕来显示运营商菜单或文本，因此若调制解调器通告类似手机的配置文件，可能会导致卡片一直等待不会发出的响应。“已禁用”会停止将工具包路由至控制点。未设置则完全保持厂商默认配置。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/wwand/graph.js:92
msgid ""
"How far the wanted signal stands above noise and interference — this, not "
"RSRP, is what throughput follows. 0 dB is the edge of usable. LTE and 5G NR "
"share these boundaries in the published tables."
msgstr "有用信号高出噪声和干扰的程度 — 吞吐量取决于此指标而非 RSRP。0 dB 是可用信号的临界点。LTE 与 5G NR 在公开标准表中共享相同的分级阈值。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wwand/status.js:304
msgid ""
"How favourably the satellites in use are spread: horizontal, positional and "
"vertical. Lower is better — under 2 is good, over 5 means the position is "
"only roughly right."
msgstr "使用中卫星的空间分布理想程度：水平、综合位置与垂直精度因子。数值越低越好 — 低于 2 为良好，高于 5 表示定位仅大致准确。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wwand/modems.js:207
msgid ""
"How many configured interfaces use this modem. Several can share one modem "
"through different mux channels."
msgstr "使用此调制解调器的已配置接口数量。多个接口可通过不同的多路复用通道共享同一个调制解调器。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/wwand/graph.js:112
msgid ""
"How many downlink carriers the modem is aggregating. The lower line is the "
"LTE anchor; the upper one is the total including 5G, so the gap between them "
"is what the 5G leg contributes — under EN-DC both legs serve one link, and "
"stacking them says that better than two separate counts. A secondary carrier "
"that is configured but not activated is not counted: it carries no data. A "
"modem that reports no carrier list at all still shows its serving cell as "
"one carrier. The total line appears only while a 5G carrier is actually "
"serving, not merely visible."
msgstr "调制解调器正在聚合的下行载波数量。下方线条为 LTE 锚点；上方线条为包含 5G 在内的总数，两者之差即为 5G 支路贡献的载波数 — 在 EN-DC 模式下两条支路共同服务于同一条链路，堆叠显示比分开统计更直观。已配置但未激活的辅载波不承载数据，因此不计入内。完全未报告载波列表的调制解调器仍会将其服务小区显示为 1 个载波。总数线条仅在 5G 载波实际提供服务（而非仅可见）时显示。"

