#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/wwand/modemopts.js:630
msgid ""
"If the modem has not answered since boot or since the outage began, pulse "
"its reset GPIO once after this many seconds. Only a modem with its own reset "
"GPIO set is touched, never another modem on the router. 0 = never."
msgstr "如果调制解调器自开机或自故障开始后一直无响应，则在经过此秒数后脉冲触发一次其复位 GPIO。仅会操作配置了专属复位 GPIO 的调制解调器，绝不会影响路由器上的其他调制解调器。0 = 从不。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wwand/status.js:292
msgid ""
"In use / in view. Nothing in view is usually the antenna, though a cold "
"receiver or a blocked sky looks the same; many in view with none in use "
"means it can hear them but not yet solve a position, which outdoors "
"typically takes a minute or two."
msgstr "使用中 / 可见。可见数为 0 通常是天线问题（冷启动接收机或天空受遮挡也会如此）；多颗可见但使用中为 0 表示已收到卫星信号但尚未解算出位置，在室外通常需要一到两分钟。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wwand/settings.js:108
msgid "Incomplete request — a required value was missing."
msgstr "请求不完整 — 缺少必填值。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wwand/status.js:1098
msgid ""
"Inferred from how many logical slots are in use. That is a lower bound: a "
"modem with a second radio stack whose other slot is empty looks exactly like "
"a single-stack one, so no definite mode can be stated."
msgstr "根据当前使用中的逻辑卡槽数量推算。这是一个下限值：具有双射频协议栈但另一个卡槽为空的调制解调器看起来与单协议栈完全相同，因此无法断定确切模式。"

