#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wwand/modems.js:775
msgid ""
"Interfaces still using a stock cellular protocol (qmi / mbim / ncm / "
"modemmanager) that wwand does not manage yet. Select the ones to migrate and "
"press \"Migrate selected\": each is converted in place to proto wwand (its "
"name, firewall zone and IP settings are kept) and a wwand modem section is "
"created and linked. When migrating a ModemManager interface, stop and remove "
"the ModemManager service afterwards — it would otherwise keep claiming the "
"modem's control port."
msgstr "仍在使用原生蜂窝协议（qmi / mbim / ncm / modemmanager）且尚未由 wwand 管理的接口。勾选要迁移的接口并点击“迁移选中项”：每个接口将就地转换为 wwand 协议（保留其名称、防火墙区域和 IP 设置），同时自动创建并关联对应的 wwand 调制解调器配置段。迁移 ModemManager 接口后，请停止并卸载 ModemManager 服务 — 否则它会继续抢占调制解调器的控制端口。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wwand/status.js:710
msgid "International Mobile Equipment Identity — the modem hardware serial"
msgstr "国际移动设备识别码 (IMEI) — 调制解调器硬件序列号"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/wwand/modemopts.js:349
msgid ""
"Kernel datapath that carries this modem's data sessions. Leave on automatic "
"unless a modem misbehaves — under automatic an installed vendor datapath "
"that recognises this hardware is used on its own. Naming one pins it. Only "
"datapaths this modem's control protocol can use are offered. What automatic "
"settled on is shown as <em>configured → actual</em> under Datapath on the "
"status page: a single interface on an MBIM modem lands on <em>untagged</em>, "
"where the session rides the parent device with no 802.1q tag on every frame, "
"and a QMI modem that turns out not to carry QMAP lands on <em>raw_ip</em>."
msgstr "承载此调制解调器数据会话的内核数据路径。除非调制解调器工作异常，否则请保持为“自动” — 在自动模式下，识别此硬件的已安装厂商数据路径会自动启用。指定名称则会强制固定。列表仅提供此调制解调器控制协议可用的数据路径。自动模式最终选定的结果会在状态页面的“数据路径”下显示为 <em>配置值 → 实际值</em>：MBIM 调制解调器上的单接口会落到 <em>untagged</em>（会话直接运行在父设备上，每帧不带 802.1q 标签），而不支持 QMAP 的 QMI 调制解调器则会落到 <em>raw_ip</em>。"

