#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/wwand/modemopts.js:667
msgid ""
"NCM modems only. How many consecutive status polls may list no data context "
"— with no received traffic in between — before wwand declares the bearer "
"dead and redials. One poll per telemetry interval, so 3 is about three "
"minutes. Lower recovers faster from a drop the modem does not announce; the "
"minimum is 2, because a single unparsed answer on an idle link must not be "
"enough to drop a working connection."
msgstr "仅适用于 NCM 调制解调器。在中间没有任何接收流量的情况下，连续多少次状态轮询未列出数据上下文后，wwand 即判定承载已死并重新拨号。每个遥测间隔轮询一次，因此 3 大约对应三分钟。数值越小，从调制解调器未主动通告的掉线中恢复得越快；最小值为 2，因为在空闲链路上仅凭单次未解析的响应绝不能断开正常工作的连接。"

