#: root/usr/share/rpcd/acl.d/luci-app-wwand.json:66
msgid ""
"Read the system log for the wwand log viewer on the modem status page. "
"SEPARATE ROLE ON PURPOSE: rpcd cannot filter a method's arguments or its "
"result, so granting `log read` grants the WHOLE system log — kernel, auth, "
"dropbear, firewall — not just the wwand lines, which are picked out in the "
"browser afterwards. Keeping it out of the luci-app-wwand role lets an "
"operator be given the modem pages without the box's logs; the viewer says it "
"cannot read them and everything else on the page still works."
msgstr "读取系统日志以供调制解调器状态页面上的 wwand 日志查看器使用。特意拆分为独立角色：rpcd 无法过滤方法的参数或返回结果，因此授予 `log read` 权限意味着允许读取整机的全部系统日志（包括内核、认证、dropbear、防火墙），而非仅仅是随后在浏览器中筛选出的 wwand 日志行。将其独立于 luci-app-wwand 角色之外，可以让管理员仅被授予调制解调器页面的访问权限而不暴露设备系统日志；此时日志查看器会提示无权读取，而页面上的所有其他功能仍正常工作。"

