#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/wwand/modemopts.js:661
msgid ""
"Reset the modem when, with a connection up, the kernel reports its transmit "
"queue stuck for this many seconds, i.e. the modem has stopped taking packets "
"(the \"NETDEV WATCHDOG\" message in the system log). 0 only records the "
"stalls in the status. Default 120 s."
msgstr "当连接处于活动状态且内核报告调制解调器发送队列卡死持续达到此秒数（即调制解调器停止接收数据包，系统日志中出现“NETDEV WATCHDOG”消息）时，重置调制解调器。0 表示仅在状态页中记录卡死次数。默认值为 120 秒。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/wwand/modemopts.js:186
msgid ""
"Reset this modem: the control protocol's soft reset first (QMI/MBIM "
"offline+reset, AT+CFUN=1,1), so it can shut down cleanly; a dedicated reset "
"GPIO is pulsed only if the modem does not reboot. Recovers a modem that hung "
"or dropped off USB."
msgstr "重置此调制解调器：首先执行控制协议的软重置（QMI/MBIM 离线+重置，或 AT+CFUN=1,1）以便其安全关机；仅当调制解调器未能重启时才会脉冲触发专用的复位 GPIO。用于恢复死机或从 USB 总线掉线的调制解调器。"

