#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/wwand/modemopts.js:682
msgid ""
"Step the system clock to the network's time (NITZ) when it is more than two "
"minutes off. Smaller differences are left to NTP. A router without a real-"
"time clock otherwise keeps its boot-time date until an NTP server is "
"reachable. The time zone is not changed."
msgstr "当系统时钟与网络时间 (NITZ) 偏差超过两分钟时，步进调整系统时钟。较小的偏差交由 NTP 处理。没有实时时钟 (RTC) 的路由器在连上 NTP 服务器之前会一直停留在开机时的初始日期。此操作不会更改时区。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wwand/modems.js:471
msgid ""
"Stop the data sessions and detach the modem from the network (radio stays "
"on). It stays detached until you attach it again or the modem is reset."
msgstr "停止数据会话并将调制解调器从网络分离（射频保持开启）。调制解调器将保持分离状态，直到您再次手动附着或重置调制解调器。"

