msgid "Switch now"
msgstr "立即切换"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wwand/settings.js:1333
msgid "Switch protocol"
msgstr "切换协议"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wwand/settings.js:1324
msgid ""
"Switch the modem firmware to %s? The modem resets and re-enumerates — its "
"connections come back on their own. A \"Control protocol\" pinned on the "
"modem page is cleared back to \"detect\", because a pin the driver "
"contradicts disables hardware recovery for this modem."
msgstr "确认将调制解调器固件切换为 %s？调制解调器将重置并重新枚举 — 其连接会自动恢复。调制解调器页面上强制指定的“控制协议”将被重置回“自动检测 (detect)”，因为与驱动程序相矛盾的协议锁定会禁用此调制解调器的硬件恢复功能。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wwand/settings.js:1323
msgid ""
"Switch the modem firmware to MBIM? The modem resets and re-enumerates. Some "
"firmwares reject MBIM even though the switch itself succeeds — if the modem "
"does not come back, switch it to QMI again. A \"Control protocol\" pinned on "
"the modem page is cleared back to \"detect\", because a pin the driver "
"contradicts disables hardware recovery for this modem."
msgstr "确认将调制解调器固件切换为 MBIM？调制解调器将重置并重新枚举。部分固件即使切换指令本身执行成功也会拒绝 MBIM 模式 — 如果调制解调器未能恢复上线，请将其切回 QMI。调制解调器页面上强制指定的“控制协议”将被重置回“自动检测 (detect)”，因为与驱动程序相矛盾的协议锁定会禁用此调制解调器的硬件恢复功能。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/wwand/modemopts.js:695
msgid ""
"Switch the modem's GNSS on. With <em>wwand-gps</em> installed wwand reads "
"the position itself: from the modem's NMEA port (reported as <em>gps_port</"
"em>; the receiver is started with the vendor AT command, the path that works "
"on Quectel and ASR modems), or — on a modem without an NMEA port — the same "
"NMEA over the QMI location service, natively or over the MBIM passthrough."
msgstr "开启调制解调器的 GNSS 功能。安装 <em>wwand-gps</em> 后，wwand 会自行读取定位信息：可从调制解调器的 NMEA 端口（报告为 <em>gps_port</em>；接收机通过厂商 AT 指令启动，适用于移远 Quectel 和翱捷科技 ASR 调制解调器）读取，或者在没有独立 NMEA 端口的调制解调器上，通过原生 QMI 或 MBIM 透传从 QMI 定位服务读取相同的 NMEA 数据。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wwand/settings.js:1314
msgid "Switch to %s"
msgstr "切换至 %s"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wwand/status.js:1067
#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/wwand/format.js:647
