"TAC = Tracking Area Code (paging area); Cell ID = the network-wide unique "
"identifier of this cell"
msgstr "TAC = 跟踪区代码（寻呼区域）；小区 ID (Cell ID) = 此小区在全网范围内的唯一标识符"

