msgstr "TX 卡死超时"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wwand/status.js:869
msgid "TX stalls"
msgstr "TX 卡死次数"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wwand/status.js:952
msgid "Technology"
msgstr "接入技术"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/wwand/modemopts.js:672
msgid "Telemetry interval"
msgstr "遥测采样间隔"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wwand/status.js:589
msgid "Temperature"
msgstr "温度"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/wwand/graph.js:120
msgid ""
"The 3G counterpart to SINR: pilot energy against everything else in the "
"carrier. Above roughly -7 dB a connection starts to suffer; the steps drawn "
"here are the common operator convention around that figure, which is less "
"firmly published than the LTE and 5G ladders. On a modem that normally runs "
"LTE, this canvas appearing at all is the news."
msgstr "3G 下相当于 SINR 的指标：导频能量与载波内所有其他能量之比。大约高于 -7 dB 时连接质量尚可，低于该值则开始恶化；此处绘制的分级阶梯是基于该数值附近的常见运营商惯例（其公开标准的严格程度不如 LTE 和 5G 阶梯）。对于通常运行在 LTE 下的调制解调器而言，出现此图表本身就说明发生了网络回落。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wwand/settings.js:1218
msgid ""
"The 3GPP usage setting the modem reports to the network: whether this device "
"is here for data or for voice. It is a preference, not a command — what the "
"network then does about voice continuity is its decision. Data centric is "
"what a router wants."
msgstr "调制解调器向网络报告的 3GPP 用途设置：表明此设备主要用于数据还是语音。这只是一项偏好声明而非强制指令 — 网络随后如何处理语音连续性由网络侧自行决定。路由器通常应选择“以数据为中心 (data centric)”。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wwand/status.js:992
msgid ""
"The 5G NR serving cell: band · centre frequency · bandwidth · Physical Cell "
"ID"
msgstr "5G NR 服务小区：频段 · 中心频率 · 带宽 · 物理小区标识 (PCI)"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wwand/status.js:936
msgid ""
"The LTE/5G attach the modem performed, and the 3GPP cause when the network "
"refused it. Reported separately from registration because the two can fail "
"independently — a wrong attach APN registers fine and never attaches"
msgstr "调制解调器执行的 LTE/5G 附着状态，以及网络拒绝附着时的 3GPP 原因码。与注册状态分开报告是因为两者可能独立失败 — 例如错误的附着 APN 可以正常完成注册，但永远无法完成附着"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wwand/modems.js:445
msgid "The PUK must be exactly 8 digits."
msgstr "PUK 码必须恰好为 8 位数字。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wwand/status.js:215
msgid ""
"The QMI LOC position session. Started when the modem registers and stopped "
"before its client is released; a firmware may accept it and still send "
"nothing, which shows as no sentences below."
msgstr "QMI LOC 定位会话。在调制解调器完成注册时启动，并在释放客户端前停止；部分固件可能会接受会话请求但仍不发送任何数据，此时下方会显示无语句。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wwand/modems.js:144
msgid ""
"The QRTR node of this modem, for a box with more than one QRTR modem. Leave "
"empty to use the first node that serves QMI DMS and WDS."
msgstr "此调制解调器的 QRTR 节点，适用于配有多个 QRTR 调制解调器的设备。留空则默认使用第一个同时提供 QMI DMS 和 WDS 服务的节点。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wwand/status.js:653
msgid ""
"The card reports itself busy. Reads of ICCID, IMSI and the PIN state will "
"fail until it clears, which is why those rows may be missing."
msgstr "卡片报告自身正忙。在其恢复空闲之前，读取 ICCID、IMSI 和 PIN 码状态均会失败，因此相关行可能暂时缺失。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wwand/modems.js:211
msgid ""
"The card the modem is using: its readiness, which physical slot is live, and "
"whether that slot holds an eUICC (eSIM)."
msgstr "调制解调器当前使用的卡片：就绪状态、当前激活的物理卡槽，以及该卡槽中是否安装了 eUICC (eSIM)。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/wwand/simlist.js:133
msgid "The card's ICCID (printed on the SIM / shown on the modem status page)."
msgstr "卡片的 ICCID（印在 SIM 卡表面 / 显示在调制解调器状态页面上）。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wwand/settings.js:473
msgid ""
"The carrier profile (MBN) the modem applies: APN defaults, IMS settings, "
"band and roaming policy for a given network. The wrong one leaves the modem "
"technically working but subtly wrong on that network — a rejected attach, no "
"IMS, a missing band."
msgstr "调制解调器应用的运营商配置文件 (MBN)：针对特定网络的默认 APN、IMS 设置、频段及漫游策略。若选错配置文件，调制解调器表面上虽能工作，但在该网络下会出现隐蔽异常 — 例如附着被拒、无 IMS、缺少频段等。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wwand/modems.js:201
msgid ""
"The control protocol wwand speaks to this modem: QMI, MBIM or NCM. Set by "
"`option protocol`, or detected from the control device."
msgstr "wwand 与此调制解调器通信所使用的控制协议：QMI、MBIM 或 NCM。可通过 `option protocol` 指定，或根据控制设备自动检测。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wwand/modems.js:215
msgid ""
"The current signal, per radio technology. RSRP is reception strength, RSRQ "
"quality, SNR the noise margin — RSRP alone does not say whether the link is "
"good."
msgstr "各无线接入技术的当前信号指标。RSRP 为接收信号强度，RSRQ 为信号质量，SNR 为信噪比裕度 — 仅凭 RSRP 一项并不能判断链路质量好坏。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wwand/modems.js:423
msgid ""
"The daemon refuses to auto-enter the PIN (%s) to protect the last attempts. "
"Enter the PIN to release it manually."
msgstr "为保护最后几次尝试机会，守护进程已拒绝自动输入 PIN 码 (%s)。请手动输入 PIN 码以解锁。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/wwand/graph.js:115
msgid ""
"The downlink bandwidth of the aggregated carriers added up, per radio "
"technology — the width of the pipe, which is what carrier aggregation is "
"for. It moves independently of the carrier count: three 10 MHz carriers are "
"less than one 20 MHz carrier. Drawn only where the modem reports a width per "
"carrier. The 5G line is usually absent for that reason: the 5G rows of the "
"carrier list carry a bandwidth whose unit this tree has not verified against "
"hardware, and a confidently wrong 100 MHz is worse than a gap."
msgstr "按无线接入技术累加的聚合载波下行总带宽 — 即管道宽度，这也是载波聚合的核心目的。它与载波数量并非简单的线性关系：3 个 10 MHz 载波的总带宽小于 1 个 20 MHz 载波。仅在调制解调器报告了每个载波的带宽时绘制。5G 线条通常不显示正是出于这一原因：载波列表中 5G 行的带宽单位尚未在实际硬件上完成核验，盲目画出一个错误的 100 MHz 还不如留空。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wwand/settings.js:70
msgid ""
"The eUICC refused to enable this profile: while a test profile is enabled, "
"only the profile that was active before it can be re-enabled (SGP.22 "
"\"wrongProfileReenabling\")."
msgstr "eUICC 拒绝启用此配置文件：当测试配置文件处于启用状态时，仅允许重新启用在其之前处于活动状态的配置文件（SGP.22“wrongProfileReenabling”）。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wwand/modems.js:196
msgid ""
"The kernel network device the modem's data runs on, with the model behind "
"it. A muxed connection names the child device (wwan0m1), not the parent."
msgstr "承载调制解调器数据的内核网络设备及其背后的硬件型号。多路复用连接会显示子设备名称（如 wwan0m1），而非父设备。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wwand/status.js:657
msgid ""
"The last thing the card said about itself: a session it closed and why, an "
"internal recovery, or an activation that did not complete."
msgstr "卡片最近一次报告的自身事件：主动关闭的会话及其原因、内部恢复操作或未完成的激活流程。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/wwand/logbox.js:366
msgid ""
"The level the wwand PROCESS logs at — not a display filter. Takes effect at "
"once and is NOT written to the configuration: a restart or a config reload "
"returns to the configured level."
msgstr "wwand 进程自身的日志记录级别 — 并非仅是页面显示过滤器。更改立即生效且不会写入配置文件：重启进程或重新加载配置后将恢复为配置文件中设定的级别。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/wwand/graph.js:82
msgid ""
"The measure to aim an antenna by, and the same steps the router's signal "
"LEDs use: the serving cell's own power, RSRP on LTE and 5G, RSCP on 3G. LTE "
"and 5G NR are graded alike, because published tables give SSB-RSRP the same "
"boundaries as LTE RSRP below 6 GHz. RSSI is a different measure on its own "
"graph."
msgstr "调整天线方向时应参考的核心指标，与路由器信号指示灯使用的分级阶梯一致：服务小区自身的信号功率（LTE 和 5G 上为 RSRP，3G 上为 RSCP）。LTE 与 5G NR 采用相同的分级标准，因为公开标准表在 6 GHz 以下为 SSB-RSRP 规定了与 LTE RSRP 相同的阈值边界。RSSI 是另一项不同的指标，绘制在单独的图表中。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wwand/settings.js:103
msgid "The modem did not answer in time."
msgstr "调制解调器未及时响应。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wwand/settings.js:99
msgid "The modem does not support that operation."
msgstr "调制解调器不支持该操作。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/wwand/esim.js:439
msgid ""
"The modem downloads over its own network attach — no router data path or APN "
"needed."
msgstr "调制解调器通过其自身的网络附着直接下载 — 无需路由器数据路径或 APN。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wwand/status.js:643
msgid ""
"The modem has not yet answered in the control protocol wwand is using, so no "
"hardware recovery step will run — repowering a modem that was never broken "
"only adds outages. Check the control protocol setting and the bound driver."
msgstr "调制解调器在 wwand 当前使用的控制协议下尚未成功响应过，因此不会执行任何硬件恢复步骤 — 对本就未损坏的调制解调器反复断电重启只会徒增断网时间。请检查控制协议设置及绑定的驱动程序。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wwand/status.js:568
msgid ""
"The modem has two independent radio switches. Software is the one wwand "
"controls and switches on at start-up; hardware is a physical switch or an "
"airplane-mode toggle on the host, which wwand cannot override — a modem held "
"off by it will not register no matter how often it is reset."
msgstr "调制解调器具有两个独立的射频开关。“软件”开关由 wwand 控制并在启动时自动开启；“硬件”开关则是物理按键或主机上的飞行模式开关，wwand 无法覆盖 — 被硬件开关关闭的调制解调器无论重置多少次都无法注册网络。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wwand/settings.js:102
msgid "The modem is busy with another operation. Try again in a moment."
msgstr "调制解调器正忙于另一项操作，请稍后重试。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wwand/status.js:602
msgid ""
"The modem is holding its own radio back — usually reduced transmit power. "
"This is the explanation for throughput that drops while the signal stays "
"good."
msgstr "调制解调器正在主动限制其射频性能 — 通常是降低发射功率。这解释了为何有时信号依然良好但吞吐量却出现下降。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wwand/settings.js:105
msgid "The modem is not ready yet."
msgstr "调制解调器尚未就绪。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/wwand/esim.js:87
msgid "The modem returned no profiles for this slot."
msgstr "调制解调器未返回此卡槽的任何配置文件。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wwand/status.js:222
msgid ""
"The modem serial port that carries NMEA sentences. wwand finds it during "
"enumeration; with wwand-gps installed it also reads it."
msgstr "输出 NMEA 语句的调制解调器串口。wwand 会在枚举设备时自动识别该端口；若安装了 wwand-gps，还会直接从中读取定位数据。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wwand/status.js:685
msgid ""
"The modem was detached from the network by hand. Its interfaces stay down "
"until it is attached again (modem list → Attach, or wwandctl attach); a "
"modem reset attaches it too."
msgstr "调制解调器已被手动从网络分离。其接口将保持关闭，直到重新附着（在调制解调器列表中点击“附着”，或执行 wwandctl attach）；重置调制解调器也会使其重新附着。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wwand/settings.js:107
msgid ""
"The modem's current radio-technology setting does not allow a band list to "
"be written."
msgstr "调制解调器当前的无线接入技术设置不允许写入频段列表。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wwand/status.js:948
msgid ""
"The network currently serving the modem, as name (MCC/MNC). MCC = country, "
"MNC = network within it"
msgstr "当前为调制解调器提供服务的网络，格式为“名称 (MCC/MNC)”。MCC = 移动国家代码，MNC = 移动网络代码"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wwand/modems.js:213
msgid ""
"The network the modem is registered on, or why it is not. A reject cause "
"here is the network refusing, not the modem failing."
msgstr "调制解调器当前注册的网络，或未能注册的原因。此处显示的拒绝原因码代表网络侧拒绝接入，而非调制解调器硬件故障。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wwand/modems.js:446
msgid "The new PIN must be 4-8 digits."
msgstr "新 PIN 码必须为 4-8 位数字。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/wwand/esim.js:391
msgid "The operation failed."
msgstr "操作失败。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wwand/status.js:712
msgid "The phone number stored on the SIM (often empty on data SIMs)"
msgstr "SIM 卡上存储的本机号码（纯流量卡通常为空）"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wwand/status.js:1097
msgid ""
"The radio-stack figures come from the modem itself (MBIM SYS_CAPS); the slot "
"count is how many slots it enumerated. A modem can advertise more slots than "
"the product actually gives you a card reader for, and may then report the "
"extra one as empty — these protocols carry no signal that separates that "
"from a reader you simply left empty."
msgstr "射频协议栈数量由调制解调器自身报告 (MBIM SYS_CAPS)；卡槽数量则是其枚举出的卡槽总数。调制解调器通告的卡槽数量可能多于设备实际引出的物理读卡器数量，此时多余的卡槽会一直显示为空 — 通信协议本身无法区分“未引出物理卡槽”与“物理卡槽未插卡”。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wwand/status.js:602
#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wwand/status.js:611
msgid "Thermal"
msgstr "温控状态"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wwand/modems.js:419
msgid ""
"This SIM is PUK-locked (%s). A WRONG PUK consumes one of ~10 attempts — "
"after the last one the SIM is permanently destroyed. The PUK is printed on "
"the SIM carrier or available from the provider."
msgstr "此 SIM 卡已被 PUK 锁定 (%s)。输入错误的 PUK 码会消耗仅有的约 10 次尝试机会 — 次数耗尽后 SIM 卡将永久报废。PUK 码印在 SIM 卡大卡托上，也可联系运营商获取。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wwand/status.js:1046
msgid "This backend does not report whether a PIN is set."
msgstr "当前后端不报告是否设置了 PIN 码。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/wwand/esim.js:278
msgid "This card is managed by %s. Profile changes are made there, not here."
msgstr "此卡由 %s 管理。配置文件的更改请在该处进行，而非本页面。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/wwand/esim.js:252
msgid ""
"This is the normal behaviour of M2M eUICCs (SGP.02) and of vendor-locked "
"cards: profiles are managed over-the-air by the SIM provider (SM-SR), so "
"downloading or switching profiles from this router is not possible. Use the "
"provider’s portal to manage the card — the router only needs to keep the "
"active profile registered and online."
msgstr "这是 M2M eUICC (SGP.02) 及运营商锁定卡片的正常行为：配置文件由 SIM 卡提供商 (SM-SR) 通过空中写卡 (OTA) 远程管理，因此无法从本路由器下载或切换配置文件。请使用提供商的管理门户来管理卡片 — 路由器只需保持当前活动配置文件正常注册和在线即可。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wwand/settings.js:1061
msgid "This modem does not expose SMS access."
msgstr "此调制解调器未开放短信访问接口。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wwand/settings.js:1234
msgid ""
"This modem forgets its bands when it is power-cycled, so they are kept in "
"the router configuration (band_lte / band_nr of the modem) and applied again "
"at every start."
msgstr "此调制解调器在断电重启后会丢失频段设置，因此频段保存在路由器配置中（调制解调器的 band_lte / band_nr），并在每次启动时重新应用。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wwand/status.js:212
msgid ""
"This modem has no NMEA port of its own, so wwand-gps asks its QMI location "
"service (LOC) for the same NMEA sentences — natively on a QMI modem, over "
"the QMI passthrough on an MBIM one."
msgstr "此调制解调器没有独立的 NMEA 端口，因此 wwand-gps 会向其 QMI 定位服务 (LOC) 请求相同的 NMEA 语句 — 在 QMI 调制解调器上通过原生接口获取，在 MBIM 调制解调器上则通过 QMI 透传获取。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/wwand/esim.js:86
msgid ""
"This modem has no native eUICC interface either, so the card cannot be "
"enumerated from the router at all."
msgstr "此调制解调器也没有原生 eUICC 接口，因此完全无法从路由器枚举该卡片。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wwand/settings.js:703
msgid "This modem restores \"%s\" before every radio-on."
msgstr "此调制解调器会在每次射频开启前恢复“%s”。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wwand/settings.js:1211
msgid "This modem's bands cannot be changed from here right now."
msgstr "当前无法在此处更改此调制解调器的频段。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wwand/settings.js:98
msgid "This modem's control backend does not offer that operation."
msgstr "此调制解调器的控制后端不提供该操作。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wwand/status.js:874
msgid ""
"This module boots radio-locked (laptop-SKU) and the modem will not register "
"while the lock is armed — set fcc_auth on the modem configuration to unlock "
"at boot"
msgstr "此模块开机即处于射频锁定状态（笔记本定制版 SKU），在锁定期间无法注册网络 — 请在调制解调器配置中设置 fcc_auth 以便在开机时自动解锁"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wwand/settings.js:1050
msgid "Tick messages and delete them in one step; shift-click selects a range."
msgstr "勾选短信即可一步批量删除；按住 Shift 键点击可连续选择范围。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wwand/modems.js:512
#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wwand/modems.js:513
msgid "Tools"
msgstr "工具"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/wwand/graph.js:87
msgid ""
"Total received power in the band — the serving cell plus its neighbours plus "
"interference. Coarser than RSRP and graded 20 dB higher (-65/-75/-85 dBm), "
"which is why it has its own graph: a strong signal reaches -46 dBm, off the "
"top of any scale drawn for RSRP. On 2G it is the only measure there is, and "
"on a modem that reports nothing better it is all you get. Each line carries "
"the radio that measured it; the plain amber one appears only when the reply "
"is untagged."
msgstr "频段内的总接收功率 — 包含服务小区、邻区以及干扰信号的总和。它比 RSRP 更粗略，且分级标准高出 20 dB（-65/-75/-85 dBm），因此单独绘制在一张图表中：强信号可达 -46 dBm，会超出专为 RSRP 设计的纵轴刻度上限。在 2G 网络下这是唯一可用的指标，对于不报告更详细指标的调制解调器而言也是唯一的数据。每条曲线对应测量该值的无线接入技术；纯琥珀色线条仅在返回值未标记制式时显示。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wwand/status.js:1005
msgid ""
"Tracking Area Identity recorded at attach: PLMN and Tracking Area Code. "
"Differs from the serving cell TAC when the modem moved without re-attaching"
msgstr "附着时记录的跟踪区标识 (TAI)：包含 PLMN 与跟踪区代码 (TAC)。当调制解调器移动后尚未重新附着时，该值可能与当前服务小区的 TAC 不同"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wwand/modems.js:665
#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wwand/status.js:46
msgid "Type"
msgstr "类型"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wwand/settings.js:730
msgid "Type · entries"
msgstr "类型 · 条目数"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wwand/settings.js:1217
msgid "UE usage"
msgstr "终端用途 (UE Usage)"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wwand/status.js:357
msgid "URB / frame size"
msgstr "URB / 帧大小"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wwand/modems.js:456
msgid "Unblock SIM"
msgstr "解锁 SIM 卡 (PUK)"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wwand/modems.js:459
#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wwand/modems.js:515
msgid "Unlock SIM"
msgstr "解锁 SIM 卡"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wwand/modems.js:440
msgid "Unlock failed: %s"
msgstr "解锁失败：%s"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wwand/modems.js:411
msgid "Unlock the blocked SIM (%s)"
msgstr "解锁已被锁定的 SIM 卡 (%s)"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wwand/status.js:375
msgid "Uplink NTB"
msgstr "上行 NTB"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wwand/status.js:365
msgid "Uplink aggregation (negotiated)"
msgstr "上行聚合（已协商）"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wwand/status.js:379
msgid "Uplink coalescing timer"
msgstr "上行合并定时器"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wwand/status.js:431
msgid "Uplink packets / frame"
msgstr "每帧上行数据包数"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wwand/status.js:127
msgid "Uptime"
msgstr "在线时长"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wwand/settings.js:686
msgid "Use here"
msgstr "在此使用"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wwand/settings.js:680
msgid "User"
msgstr "用户"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wwand/settings.js:536
msgid "User list (SIM EF 6F60)"
msgstr "用户列表 (SIM EF 6F60)"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/wwand/simlist.js:206
msgid "Username for the APN authentication."
msgstr "用于 APN 认证的用户名。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/wwand/modemopts.js:241
msgid ""
"Username for the attach bearer. Ignored without an attach APN — it would "
"otherwise apply to whatever APN the modem's attach profile already held."
msgstr "用于附着承载的用户名。未设置附着 APN 时将被忽略 — 否则它会错误地应用到调制解调器附着配置文件中原有的 APN 上。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/wwand/modemopts.js:431
msgid ""
"Vendor AT commands sent once after the modem is detected, before "
"registration."
msgstr "检测到调制解调器后、注册网络前发送一次的厂商自定义 AT 指令。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/wwand/esim.js:29
msgid "Verifying server"
msgstr "正在验证服务器"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wwand/status.js:231
msgid ""
"What parses the NMEA and publishes a position. Not reading is a different "
"thing from having no fix — the receiver may be perfectly happy and nobody "
"listening."
msgstr "负责解析 NMEA 并发布位置信息的服务。“未在读取”与“尚未定位”是两回事 — 接收机本身可能工作完全正常，只是没有任何程序在监听端口。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wwand/status.js:860
msgid ""
"What the hardware step of the recovery ladder would actually do on this box "
"for this modem — asked of the same code that performs it, not inferred."
msgstr "故障恢复阶梯中的硬件恢复步骤在此设备上针对此调制解调器实际会执行的操作 — 直接查询执行恢复的代码，而非猜测。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wwand/sims.js:91
msgid "Where"
msgstr "所在位置"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wwand/modems.js:209
msgid ""
"Where the modem is in its bring-up: from ABSENT through SIM_UNLOCK and "
"REGISTERING to READY. A state that does not advance is what the log explains."
msgstr "调制解调器在启动流程中所处的阶段：从 ABSENT（不在位）经由 SIM_UNLOCK（解锁 SIM 卡）和 REGISTERING（正在注册）直至 READY（就绪）。如果状态停滞不前，可通过下方日志排查原因。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wwand/status.js:671
msgid ""
"Whether the modem offers QMI UIM Remote, the service a modem needs to run on "
"a SIM card that is not in its own slot (a card in a reader, a phone, or "
"another modem — the wwand-rsim package). Read from the services the modem "
"lists itself; a Quectel lists it even while its switch for it is off "
"(wwandctl rsim MODEM switch)."
msgstr "调制解调器是否提供 QMI UIM Remote 服务 — 调制解调器使用非自身卡槽中的 SIM 卡（如位于独立读卡器、手机或另一台调制解调器中的卡片，需配合 wwand-rsim 软件包）时所需的核心服务。直接读取自调制解调器自身列出的服务清单；移远 (Quectel) 模块即使在该功能的开关处于关闭状态时也会列出此服务（可通过 wwandctl rsim MODEM switch 切换）。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wwand/status.js:225
msgid ""
"Whether the modem's own GNSS engine has been switched on. wwand starts it "
"with the vendor AT command when `option gnss` is set; without that the port "
"exists and nothing is sent on it."
msgstr "调制解调器自身的 GNSS 引擎是否已开启。设置 `option gnss` 后，wwand 会通过厂商 AT 指令启动它；未设置时，虽然端口存在但不会输出任何数据。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wwand/settings.js:1215
msgid ""
"Which generations the modem may use. Unchecking one stops it being used at "
"all — a modem restricted to 5G will not fall back to LTE where 5G is absent, "
"so leave everything the network offers checked unless you are deliberately "
"pinning a technology."
msgstr "允许调制解调器使用的网络制式代际。取消勾选某一代际将完全禁止使用该制式 — 仅限制为 5G 的调制解调器在无 5G 覆盖的区域将不会回落到 LTE，因此除非您有意强制锁定某种制式，否则请保持勾选网络提供的所有制式。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wwand/modems.js:130
msgid "Which modem, and its SIM."
msgstr "所属调制解调器及其 SIM 卡。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wwand/settings.js:1220
msgid ""
"Which networks the modem may register on. \"Home only\" refuses roaming "
"partners outright — useful against accidental cross-border charges, and the "
"reason a SIM that works elsewhere may show \"no service\" here."
msgstr "允许调制解调器注册的网络范围。“仅归属网络”会直接拒绝所有漫游合作网络 — 可有效防止跨国境时产生意外漫游资费，同时也是某些在其他设备上正常的 SIM 卡在此处显示“无服务”的原因。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/wwand/modemopts.js:211
msgid ""
"Which protocol wwand uses to drive this modem. Leave on \"detect\" — this "
"exists for a control device whose driver wwand cannot classify, and it will "
"say so in the log. Pinning a protocol that contradicts a driver wwand does "
"recognise disables hardware recovery for this modem, because an answering AT "
"port would then prove nothing."
msgstr "wwand 用于驱动此调制解调器的控制协议。请保持为“自动检测 (detect)” — 此选项仅用于其驱动程序无法被 wwand 自动识别分类的控制设备（此时日志中会明确提示）。如果强制指定的协议与 wwand 已识别的驱动程序相矛盾，将禁用此调制解调器的硬件恢复功能，因为此时即使 AT 端口有响应也无法证明设备正常工作。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wwand/settings.js:1079
msgid ""
"Which store to list and delete from — the SIM card or the modem's own "
"memory. They are read one at a time, so a message you expect and cannot see "
"may simply be in the other one. A full store silently stops accepting new "
"messages."
msgstr "要列出和删除短信的存储位置 — SIM 卡或调制解调器自身存储。每次仅读取其中一个存储区，因此如果您找不到预期的短信，它可能保存在另一个存储区中。存储区满后会静默停止接收新短信。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wwand/settings.js:850
msgid ""
"Without this the lock is lost on the next modem reset — which is the safer "
"default: a persisted lock survives a reboot, so a cell that disappears "
"leaves the modem searching for it with no obvious way back short of clearing "
"the lock by hand."
msgstr "若不勾选此项，锁定设置将在下次调制解调器重置时失效 — 这是更安全的默认行为：持久化锁定在设备重启后依然保留，一旦锁定的小区消失，调制解调器将一直盲目搜索该小区，除非手动清除锁定否则无法自行恢复联网。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wwand/settings.js:612
